  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Your paired soul observes your prey like a predator, studying it and spying for weaknesses. During your daily preparations, select a monster family, such as ‘Beast’. ‘Plant’ or ‘Celestial’. Against creatures of these families until your next daily preparations, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to your checks to Seek, Track, or Recall Knowledge. This bonus also applies to Learning an Anima spell from these creatures.</p><p>When you gain the Monster Affinity feature, this bonus automatically applies to creatures that are part of the category of your selected Monster Affinity.</p>"
